  "caveats": [
    "Phonon-2 original 164 MB package and transcribe.cpp Q8_0 739,508,608-byte artifact are different configurations; never substitute scores or sizes.",
    "FLEURS uses a fixed fr/de/es/it/pt panel; nl/hy are detail columns. Missing languages cannot be filled from another corpus or a smaller panel.",
    "Long-form core uses CORAAL alone to avoid counting Earnings22 in two core families. MCV/MLS, robustness and alternate English protocols are secondary.",
    "Unknown run operators qualify every dependent index. Unknown model availability dates remain null and current-only; historical replay uses availability, not result publication dates.",
    "Handy catalog cells preserve legacy-published provenance, CI95, utterance counts, engine SHA and quantization. Community publication is not proof of independent reproduction.",
    "Private FFASR corpus was inspected; its public config exposed no scored rows. No FFASR scores or family votes are invented.",
    "Gladia rates are EUR, not USD. Soniox hourly equivalents are token workload estimates, so only its actual token tariffs are imported.",
    "Mistral hosted Transcribe 2602 is not the open Realtime 4B checkpoint; neither hosted score nor release date is inferred.",
    "Some Hub model cards require authorization or are unavailable; their identities cite the benchmark publication, with unknown dates/access retained where unsupported."
  ]
}
